PROJECT: WAFFLE POPS AND COMPANY — FULL-STACK ONLINE ORDERING PLATFORM

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, security engineer and QA engineer. Build a complete, production-oriented online ordering application for Waffle Pops and Company, a dessert business specializing in Belgian-style waffles, signature stuffed waffles, chocolate-dripping waffle pops and related desserts.

Do not merely describe the application or produce a static mockup. Implement the actual frontend, backend, database schema, migrations, functional customer workflows, protected admin workflows, tests and deployment documentation. Inspect the existing workspace first and preserve working code when extending an existing project.

