==================================================

Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite.
Styling: Tailwind CSS and reusable accessible UI components.
Backend: Node.js + Express + TypeScript.
Database: PostgreSQL.
ORM and migrations: Prisma.
API: REST with validated request/response schemas.
Testing: Vitest or Jest for unit tests and an appropriate HTTP integration-testing library.
API documentation: OpenAPI or a clear equivalent.
Version control: Git-compatible project structure.

Initial launch branch: Mandadam.
Branch address: Main Road, opposite Krupa Bangalore Bakery Shop, Mandadam, Andhra Pradesh.
Address is provisional until confirmed by the business owner.
Ordering methods: delivery and takeaway.
