Initial branding direction: chocolate brown, waffle gold and cream, with restrained berry accents.
All unverified business details must be configurable. Never invent the official logo, verified product catalog, exact prices, contact number, business hours, delivery radius, customer reviews or payment credentials.

Use INR throughout. Example menu prices may be seeded only as clearly labeled DEMO DATA and must never be presented as verified business prices.

