8. ORDER MANAGEMENT AND CUSTOMER TRACKING
==================================================

Create a persistent order tracking page with:
- Order number.
- Current status.
- Timestamped progress timeline.
- Items and quantities.
- Bill and payment status.
- Delivery address or pickup information.
- Estimated delivery/pickup window, only when configured.
